@startuml 3.9.1 - Upgrade Plan
title Sequence Diagram — 3.9.1 - Upgrade Plan

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
entity "Web dashboard" as webdashboard
boundary "SubscriptionController" as subscriptioncontroll
control "SubscriptionService" as subscriptionservice
entity "UserSubscriptionRepository" as usersubscriptionrepo
entity "SubscriptionPlanRepository" as subscriptionplanrepo
actor "USER (own account)" as userownaccount

' === Flow ===
subscriptionservice -> subscriptionservice: Check session, scope and account ownership
subscriptionservice -> subscriptionservice: Check higher destination, current version and server quote
userownaccount -> webdashboard: Compare plans and confirm higher plan
activate webdashboard
webdashboard -> subscriptioncontroll: POST /api/v1/subscription
activate subscriptioncontroll
subscriptioncontroll -> subscriptionservice: subscribe(user, command)
activate subscriptionservice
subscriptionservice -> usersubscriptionrepo: Load owned subscription
activate usersubscriptionrepo
usersubscriptionrepo --> subscriptionservice: UserSubscription
deactivate usersubscriptionrepo
subscriptionservice -> subscriptionplanrepo: Load plan catalog
activate subscriptionplanrepo
subscriptionplanrepo --> subscriptionservice: SubscriptionPlan
deactivate subscriptionplanrepo

loop invalid session / forbidden / unavailable resource
  subscriptionservice --> subscriptioncontroll: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  deactivate subscriptionservice
  subscriptioncontroll --> webdashboard: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  deactivate subscriptioncontroll
  webdashboard --> userownaccount: Display access or resource error
end
activate subscriptionservice
activate subscriptioncontroll


loop Enterprise / invalid destination / stale quote
  subscriptionservice --> subscriptioncontroll: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  deactivate subscriptionservice
  subscriptioncontroll --> webdashboard: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  deactivate subscriptioncontroll
  webdashboard --> userownaccount: Display ALREADY_AT_HIGHEST_PLAN or invalid upgrade
end
activate subscriptionservice
activate subscriptioncontroll

subscriptionservice --> subscriptioncontroll: 200 OK
deactivate subscriptionservice
subscriptioncontroll --> webdashboard: 200 OK
deactivate subscriptioncontroll
webdashboard --> userownaccount: Display checkout / payment processing; retain current plan until provisioned
deactivate webdashboard

@enduml